	give player a diamond sword of sharpness 2
	give player 5 of stone
	give player 2 oak planks
	give player 3 stone bricks
	give player a dirt block
	give player speed potion
	give player potion of swiftness
	give player splash potion of zzz
	give player minecraft:stone
